        "text": "Bar 1 spells all of {{chord 1}} from the top: b5, b3, root and b7. The triplet in bar 2 is the 3rd, 5th and b7 of {{chord 2}}, and bar 3 comes down through the 5th, b3 and root of {{chord 3}} to its 6th, {{note 3.5}}, the note that gives a minor 6 chord its sound."
      },
      {
        "topic": "tensions",
        "notes": [
