          ]
        ],
        "text": "{{note 2.4}} is the b9 of {{chord 2}}, the dark, tense colour of a dominant chord in a minor key. It is the same pitch as {{note 1.2}}, the b5 of {{chord 1}}, so that note ties the whole minor ii–V together."
      },
      {
